{"id":"5965","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5965_main_invading-cirrostratus-fibratus-duplicatus-undulatus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>照片为侵入的毛卷层云，呈连续云纱状，在地平线上45°以上。照片中有两层卷层云。下层处于地影中，呈<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">灰色</span>，而上层有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">从西南方向飘来的毛状云带</span>（左下至右上）；在该云层中还可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">波型</span>。波型与云层高度的风相垂直，证明可确认为波状云类。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Michael Bruhn","location":"澳大利亚，维多利亚州，阿斯彭代尔花园","latitude":"纬度: 38° 1' 28'' S","longitude":"经度: 145° 6' 48'' E","date":"21 February 2016 1902 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西西南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 6","code":"图像P/S代码: P.3.13","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.3.13"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5965_syn_invading-cirrostratus-fibratus-duplicatus-undulatus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>从澳大利亚北部向塔斯马尼亚延伸的宽低压槽</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 澳大利亚联邦2016，澳大利亚气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5965_upper_invading-cirrostratus-fibratus-duplicatus-undulatus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>303-274 hPa（9700 – 10300米）的高空水汽</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5965_sat_invading-cirrostratus-fibratus-duplicatus-undulatus_clouds.jpeg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>葵花-8卫星13号通道红外图像显示出西北热带云带的北边缘，移动方向平行于澳大利亚维多利亚西海岸线。高空脊位于141° E；高空脊东边，西南风将云团平流输送到维多利亚中南部。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 日本气象厅","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4496_main_cirrostratus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>（注：估计为九月的某一天）</p>\n<p>一个边界清晰的卷层云边缘<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">从1</span><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">延伸至2</span>，并伴有一条明显的光学增厚带<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">从3</span><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">延伸至4</span>。卷层云已从头顶经过，正移入晴空区。因此，天空在距地平线45度以上有一层连续的卷层云面纱，但并未完全覆盖，故编码为C<sub>H</sub> = 6。</p>\n<p>一股强短波槽正从西方靠近俄克拉荷马州。</p></div>","copyright":"© C.A. Doswell","location":"Norman, Oklahoma,, United States of America","latitude":"纬度: 35° 13' 21'' N","longitude":"经度: 97° 26' 22'' W","date":"15 September 1976 1500 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 6","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}